MP2 (net4 net5 VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
MP3 (Vin net5 VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
MP4 (net5 net3 net0 VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
MP5 (net2 net4 net0 VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
Q1 (VSS VSS net3) sky130_fd_pr__pnp_05v5_W0p68L0p68
Q2 (VSS VSS net1) sky130_fd_pr__pnp_05v5_W0p68L0p68
R5 (net4 net1) resistor r=1k
R6 (Vin VSS) resistor r=1k
R7 (net3 VSS) resistor r=1k
R8 (net4 VSS) resistor r=1k
